===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|dagr||day|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{m|gem-pro|*dagaz||day}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|fo}} {{m|ine-pro|*dʰegʷʰ-||to burn}}.

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|m|dags|dagar}}

# [[day]], the time between sunrise and sunset
# [[daylight]]
# day, 24 hours
# ({{g|p}}) [[life]], [[lifetime]]
# [[consciousness]]

